message: "If you use these teaching materials, please cite them as below."
type: software
title: "Battery Lifetime Prediction Laboratory"
abstract: >-
  Teaching materials for an STM32 laboratory on embedded systems power
  profiling and battery lifetime prediction: firmware template, itemis CREATE
  statechart, add-on board schematic, bill of materials, assembly guide and
  laboratory handout. Developed for the course Embedded Systems at Kaunas
  University of Technology.
